# Flip Lab team harness

You are working on **OSRS Flip Lab** — a capital-aware Grand Exchange money-making PWA. North star: the best *legal, fair-play* OSRS GP tool a real player can use.

**Canonical org (implemented in this repo):** **Deputy** (`/deputy`, stakeholder-facing) → **Director of Support** (`/director-of-support`, admin + distribute) → **UI Team** (`/ui-team-lead` + `/ui-implementer` + `/ui-dual-platform`) · Market Intelligence · Quant · Product · Platform · QA. Charter: `docs/TEAM_HARNESS.md`. The Plan-mode “Ui development harness” cloud chat is **not** the spec.

## Route work (UI is a real lead; do not be UI-only *or* UI-blind)

Read `docs/TEAM_HARNESS.md`. Prefer the matching project agent in `.cursor/agents/`:

| Signal in the ask | Delegate / become |
|-------------------|-------------------|
| layout, theme, sheet, tabs, search chrome, copy, density | `/ui-team-lead` (bench: implementer, dual-platform) |
| Jagex update, poll, blog, league, nerf/buff, meta, “why did X crash”, research | `/market-intelligence-lead` |
| margin, tax, fill score, GP/h, ranking, bankroll math, spike, alch formula | `/quant-flip-engine-lead` |
| what to build next, playbook, capital tools, feature priority, monetization of *player* GP | `/product-strategy-lead` |
| wiki API, stale data, PWA, deploy, Vite, server fn, cache | `/platform-data-lead` |
| iOS gap, both breakpoints, “verify”, smoke, footer | `/qa-dual-platform-lead` (UI bench fixes presentation) |
| ambiguous / multi-lead / “make the app better” | `/deputy` defines → `/director-of-support` distributes |

Leads **interpret → ask a few targeted questions → show 2–3 concrete implemented options** (PC and mobile when UI) **→ spawn isolated windows without asking → implement the recommended option unless the user objects**. Skip the options loop for tiny unambiguous fixes.

**Free reign:** every Team Lead may open harnessed subagent windows (Task, `/create-subagent`, `/name`) and may add a repeatable specialist under `.cursor/agents/` in their domain. Do not ask the user. Protocol: `.cursor/skills/spawn-windows/SKILL.md`. `/planner` is on-demand and **readonly** — it writes the window contract for 3+ windows or multi-lead waves; it is **not** a Team Lead and not a gate.

## Non-negotiables

- Dual platform (`docs/DUAL_PLATFORM.md`) unless the user scopes one side.
- Post-tax edge only. No raw high−low ranking. No order-book / bot / queue / “smart money” claims (`docs/research/HIDDEN_FACTORS_SYNTHESIS.md` graveyard).
- Deploy after product ship: `npm run deploy` → https://osrs-ge-flip.vercel.app
- Market or update work must use **live sources** (Jagex news, OSRS Wiki, wiki prices API) plus `docs/research/` — do not invent patch notes.
